  Description: "Brood Rush: GoalsScored. Each fauna wave is the team's brood, carried on one representative player of the controlling domain and summed by domain for the race. Fitness follows that carrier. Score is the pilot's VC + VD (the scoreboard's volume books), is not weighted here and is not negated."
